{"id":"b1118344012e3e87","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-W-e.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Set Encoding","display":"df-W-e — Recursively Enumerable Set Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-W-e","aliases":["57-df-W-e","57-df-re-set"],"display":"df-W-e — Recursively Enumerable Set Encoding","depends_on":["[[57-df-phi-e]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-halt-notation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-W-e"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-W-e</span><span>57-df-re-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-W-e — Recursively Enumerable Set Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-W-e-—-Recursively-Enumerable-Set-with-Index-e\">df-W-e — Recursively Enumerable Set with Index e</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(e \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (程序索引)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> (通用图灵机, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}W\\text{-}e} \\vdash W_e \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : \\varphi_e(x) \\downarrow\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}W\\text{-}e} \\vdash W_e \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : \\varphi_e(x) \\downarrow\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> is the set of inputs on which program <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> halts.</li>\n<li>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span>&quot; means <strong>halts</strong>: see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a></li>\n<li>The notation comes from <strong>Recursion Theory</strong> (Computability Theory):\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> = &quot;the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>-th recursively enumerable set&quot;</li>\n<li>Standard notation from Rogers (1967) and Soare (2016)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Equivalently: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e = \\mathrm{dom}(\\varphi_e) = \\{x : \\exists y\\;T(e, x, y)\\}\">\\(W_e = \\mathrm{dom}(\\varphi_e) = \\{x : \\exists y\\;T(e, x, y)\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-W-e-—-Recursively-Enumerable-Set-with-Index-e","text":"df-W-e — Recursively Enumerable Set with Index e","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-phi-e","status":"resolved","id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-phi-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-halt-notation","status":"resolved","id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-halt-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-phi-e","status":"resolved","id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ (通用图灵机, see [[57-df-phi-e]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-halt-notation","status":"resolved","id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"\"$\\downarrow$\" means **halts**: see [[90-df-halt-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Equivalently: $W_e = \\mathrm{dom}(\\varphi_e) = \\{x : \\exists y\\;T(e, x, y)\\}$ (see [[90-df-t-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}W\\text{-}e} \\vdash W_e \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : \\varphi_e(x) \\downarrow\\}","display":true},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e 